      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.linear(x)。",
        "执行 y = x @ weight.T + bias。",
        "输入 x 形状为 [batch_size, in_features]，weight 形状为 [out_features, in_features]。",
        "输出形状为 [batch_size, out_features]。"
